==History==
2020
*The Electro Spirit was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Electro Spirit Challenge]], which started on 14/10/2020. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], the player would build a [[Battle Decks|deck]] which included the Electro Spirit. If the player achieved at least 7 wins, they obtained the Electro Spirit early.
*The Electro Spirit [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 2/11/2020.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], added the Electro Spirit to all Draft selections.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue where the Electro Spirit's [[Star Points|Star Level]] used the sound effects of the [[Ice Spirit]].
*On 27/6/2022, the [[Version History#Summer 2022 Update (27/6/2022)|Summer 2022 Update]], added the Shocking Behavior [[Card Mastery]] task for the Electro Spirit.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Electro Spirit from Electro Valley to Spell Valley. It also fixed a bug where [[Sparky]] was not reset when hit by Electro Spirit at the same time she was being hooked by [[Fisherman]].
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 24/11/2025, increased the Level cap of all cards to 16 (from 15).
*On 1/12/2025, the Heroes Update, decreased the Electro Spirit's projectile speed to 1000 (from 2000), and increased it's Shock Chain Period to 0.25 seconds (from 0.2 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Electro Spirit's hitpoints by 6%

